menu "Rezonating bring-up"

    config BRINGUP_DIAG
        bool "Run the [DIAG] ADC SPI setting matrix at boot"
        default n
        help
            Bit-banged reference plus one probe per SPI setting, then use the first setting that passes.
            Off by default: the boot uses the fixed setting found on 2026-11-01 (mode 1, 2 MHz,
            cs_ena_pretrans 2, cs_ena_posttrans 2).

endmenu
